  "solution": {
    "text": "Elongation in spring is given by <math> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mi>m</mi> <mi>k</mi> </mfrac> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <msub> <mi>g</mi> <mrow> <mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow> </mrow> </math><br /><br />When the cage is moving up by acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />When the cage is moving down with acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />When the cage is moving with acceleration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> horizontally<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>"
